<node id="Antvis/Mcp-Server-Chart">
  <data key="d0">Antvis/Mcp-Server-Chart</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Antvis/Mcp-Server-Chart is a visualization MCP service containing over 25 visual charts using @antvis, used for chart generation and data analysis.&lt;SEP&gt;Antvis/Mcp-Server-Chart is a technology selection option mentioned in the context of MCP service integration.&lt;SEP&gt;Antvis/Mcp-Server-Chart is a visualization MCP service containing over 25 visual charts using @antvis, used for chart generation and data analysis.&lt;SEP&gt;Antvis/Mcp-Server-Chart is a visualization MCP service that contains over 25 visual charts using @antvis, designed for chart generation and data analysis.&lt;SEP&gt;Antvis/Mcp-Server-Chart is a chart generation tool or MCP server referenced in the document section about MCP services.</data>
