<node id="Apconw/Gpt-Vis-Api">
  <data key="d0">Apconw/Gpt-Vis-Api</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Apconw/Gpt-Vis-Api is a technical option mentioned in the context of MCP services.&lt;SEP&gt;Apconw/Gpt-Vis-Api is a lightweight chart generation service that addresses the limitations of antv/mcp-server-chart in private deployment.&lt;SEP&gt;Apconw/Gpt-Vis-Api is the specific service deployed that receives JSON data requests, uses AntV/G to generate charts, uploads chart images to MinIO storage, and returns presigned URLs for frontend access.</data>
