<node id="Mcphub">
  <data key="d0">Mcphub</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">MCPHub is a technical option mentioned in the context of MCP services.&lt;SEP&gt;MCPHub is a tool with a built-in MCP server marketplace containing many commonly used MCP servers, supporting one-click installation and automatic configuration to simplify environment setup, and can be deployed via Docker on any Docker-supporting platform.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-bf33c09cef21a9234b885adc19237c75&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2c6746154ee72afea8c47d8e88a7e50e</data>
