<node id="Model Context Protocol">
  <data key="d0">Model Context Protocol</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Model Context Protocol is the full name of MCP, an open-source protocol for standardizing LLM and external tool integration.&lt;SEP&gt;Model Context Protocol is the full name of MCP, a protocol for connecting models with external tools and services.&lt;SEP&gt;Model Context Protocol is the full name of MCP, a protocol whose underlying principles and integration with large models are discussed, including how it connects to large models.</data>
