<node id="MCP Server">
  <data key="d0">MCP Server</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">MCP Server refers to a server component or service that operates within the Model Context Protocol (MCP) ecosystem, acting as an intermediary between AI models and external tools, resources, or applications. It exchanges JSON-RPC 2.0 messages with clients, handling requests such as `tools/list`, `resources/list`, `prompts/list`, and `tools/call`. MCP servers expose tools or apps for clients to invoke and can be freely combined with open-source models. Such servers are often available through marketplaces like the ModelScope MCP marketplace.

MCP servers frequently depend on multiple runtimes such as Node.js and Python, requiring manual maintenance of numerous commands, parameters, and environment variables. A representative implementation is the FastMCP-based server defined in `mcpserver.py`, which registers weather and stock query tools and runs an HTTP service with SSE transport on host `127.0.0.1`, port `4200`, and path prefix `/demo`, with debug log level. Another variant runs with SSE transport on host `127.0.0.1`, port `4200`, path `/demo`, and debug log level. A Node.js-based MCP server runs in SSE transport mode, started with the command `node build/index.js --transport sse` from the directory `E:\mcp-server-chart-main\mcp-server-chart-main`, and handles JSON-RPC 2.0 requests from clients. Yet another instance runs on `host.docker.internal:1122`, supports `initialize` and `tools/list`, but returns "Method not found" for `resources/list`, `resources/templates/list`, and `prompts/list`. The MCP Server is also represented by the Python logo in some contexts, and is discussed as a technical topic related to the deployment and integration of services.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-bf33c09cef21a9234b885adc19237c75&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7dfd9edaf2d6d316a2d66cb563a7b6fd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-028b6088d3cdecf0364e7e5da0b83b66&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a0f8c4393df9c460f378b7662edd6707&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-629ff97ba9b08501fb91ecc6de8ffc80&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2c6746154ee72afea8c47d8e88a7e50e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-72d350e3bb80f0fef24e7c96667c4d8a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-677387b0d12710d9b55ebc13fd550e1e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d14809c97d977d90b6981933292df49d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-61cfd720b0bb2ed54aa4a2374dc11cca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b5ad16c20174c91752cb2d9fe2947a8f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6cb0f2f468eb972869d2a51b23a64211</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/drw/PycharmProjects/RAG-Anything-reproduction/data/MCP服务.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791615465</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
