  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">FORCE_VERIFYING_SIGNATURE is a configuration field in the /docker/.env file that when set to false disables plugin signature verification.&lt;SEP&gt;FORCE_VERIFYING_SIGNATURE is a configuration field that, when set to false, disables signature verification for plugin installation.&lt;SEP&gt;FORCE_VERIFYING_SIGNATURE is a configuration field that, when set to false, allows the Dify platform to install all plugins not reviewed on the Dify Marketplace.</data>
