  <data key="d0">Taitung County</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">Taitung County is a location whose military facilities were queried in a workflow.&lt;SEP&gt;Taitung County is a region in Taiwan that includes various military facilities such as radar, air defense, port, airport, camp, coast guard, and shooting range facilities.&lt;SEP&gt;Taitung County is a location whose military facilities were queried by a user in the Dify chat interface.&lt;SEP&gt;Taitung County is the region whose military facilities are the subject of the hierarchical chart.&lt;SEP&gt;Taitung County is a location whose military facilities are being queried in a preview example combining text and charts.&lt;SEP&gt;Taitung County is a region in Taiwan that includes military facilities such as Fugang Camp, Air Force Zhihang Base, Air Force Taimali Range, and Zhiben Camp.</data>
