<node id="VIS_REQUEST_SERVER">
  <data key="d0">VIS_REQUEST_SERVER</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">VIS_REQUEST_SERVER is a URL setting used to configure the request server for chart generation.&lt;SEP&gt;VIS_REQUEST_SERVER is an environment variable through which the URL address of the deployed service is passed.&lt;SEP&gt;VIS_REQUEST_SERVER is an environment variable used to pass the URL address of the GPT-Vis-SSR HTTP service.&lt;SEP&gt;VIS_REQUEST_SERVER is an environment variable used to pass the URL address of the deployed GPT-Vis-SSR service.&lt;SEP&gt;VIS_REQUEST_SERVER is an environment variable in the MCP server configuration that holds the user's private service address.&lt;SEP&gt;VIS_REQUEST_SERVER is an environment variable that stores the URL for the gpt-vis-api service, defaulting to 'http://localhost:3100/generate'.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-5e6331e7987020e8aab4119b9099c8c7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-545b90e2cab5ad4d8fede3a9c2c4f58f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6c5109d1ac12173a5f2731bc015b2d44&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b546446cf6afd391433a0d3a55406647&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-04514b92a1febfe72cc9e7fdebe469e1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b5ad16c20174c91752cb2d9fe2947a8f</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/drw/PycharmProjects/RAG-Anything-reproduction/data/MCP服务.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791615467</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="GPT-Vis">
  <data key="d0">GPT-Vis</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">GPT-Vis is a visualization solution that enables large models to generate visualizations from natural language, as described in the CSDN blog "一語成圖".&lt;SEP&gt;GPT-Vis is an open-source project by AntV providing vision components for GPTs, generative AI, and LLM projects, including UI components.&lt;SEP&gt;GPT-Vis is a project that enables large models to generate visualizations from natural language, referenced in the context of chart generation.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-5e6331e7987020e8aab4119b9099c8c7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-68766f592d5fea97b491b07c0e727f6e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b5ad16c20174c91752cb2d9fe2947a8f</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/drw/PycharmProjects/RAG-Anything-reproduction/data/MCP服务.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791615482</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="CSDN Blog">
  <data key="d0">CSDN Blog</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">The CSDN blog titled "「一語成圖」：GPT-Vis × MCP讓大模型「說句話就出可視化」" discusses the integration of GPT-Vis and MCP.&lt;SEP&gt;A CSDN blog post titled "MCP-server-chart部署及踩坑建议" that discusses the deployment of the MCP-server-chart and related pitfalls.&lt;SEP&gt;CSDN Blog is the source of the article titled "「⼀语成图」：GPT-Vis × MCP让⼤模型「说句话就出可视化」" discussing GPT-Vis and MCP.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-5e6331e7987020e8aab4119b9099c8c7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9e438aec0e2c5ce9de0dd0bb23713997&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-68766f592d5fea97b491b07c0e727f6e</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/drw/PycharmProjects/RAG-Anything-reproduction/data/MCP服务.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791615465</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="AntV">
  <data key="d0">AntV</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">AntV is a charting and visualization library, as well as an organization, involved in several projects and applications. As a charting library, AntV is used by GPT-Vis-SSR and GPT-VIS-API to generate charts such as line and bar charts. It is also the organization that develops the GPT-Vis and GPT-Vis-SSR projects, and is consistently described as the organization behind the GPT-Vis-SSR project. Additionally, AntV is a visualization library integrated with large models to implement lightweight graphical data Q&amp;A display for Text2SQL.

In the context of the Sanic-Web dashboard, AntV is a charting library that may have been used to generate the bar chart, and it is also used to generate the funnel chart. As a visualization solution provider, AntV's logo and technology are used in the AntV Visualization Charts plugin. Furthermore, AntV is a visualization tool that is decompressed on the Baode server.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-5e6331e7987020e8aab4119b9099c8c7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-68766f592d5fea97b491b07c0e727f6e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-56f8883c6fffe7e65586c4a3b4ad8f88&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-46181a4ab3fb239f80f036ff52b8d520&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b546446cf6afd391433a0d3a55406647&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-04514b92a1febfe72cc9e7fdebe469e1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b5ad16c20174c91752cb2d9fe2947a8f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a4dc8e8aa6c1ab5915ad672a074c2adb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f28345b99168d6f816c3bff9402b4a89&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d44e3b316c15841047ae8db2e5bc076a</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/drw/PycharmProjects/RAG-Anything-reproduction/data/MCP服务.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791615483</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="GPT-Vis-SSR">
  <data key="d0">GPT-Vis-SSR</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">GPT-Vis-SSR is an AntV project that can be deployed as an HTTP service on one's own server.&lt;SEP&gt;GPT-Vis-SSR is an AntV project that can be deployed as an HTTP service in a private environment, with its URL address passed through the env VIS_REQUEST_SERVER.&lt;SEP&gt;GPT-Vis-SSR is a project by AntV that can be used to deploy an HTTP service in a private environment and wrapped into a POST service.&lt;SEP&gt;GPT-Vis-SSR is an AntV project that can be deployed as an HTTP service in a private environment, with its URL address passed through the environment variable VIS_REQUEST_SERVER.&lt;SEP&gt;GPT-Vis-SSR is a rendering library imported as @antv/gpt-vis-ssr that renders a spec into an image buffer.&lt;SEP&gt;GPT-Vis-SSR is an AntV project that can be deployed as an HTTP service on one's own server for chart generation.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-5e6331e7987020e8aab4119b9099c8c7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-68766f592d5fea97b491b07c0e727f6e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6c5109d1ac12173a5f2731bc015b2d44&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b546446cf6afd391433a0d3a55406647&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-04514b92a1febfe72cc9e7fdebe469e1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b5ad16c20174c91752cb2d9fe2947a8f</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/drw/PycharmProjects/RAG-Anything-reproduction/data/MCP服务.pdf</data>
