<node id="MinIO">
  <data key="d0">MinIO</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">MinIO is an object storage service where GPT-VIS-API uploads generated chart images and returns presigned URLs with expiration.&lt;SEP&gt;MinIO is a storage service to which gpt-vis-api uploads generated chart images and returns pre-signed URLs for frontend access.&lt;SEP&gt;MinIO is a storage system where the image associated with the table can be viewed.</data>
