<node id="Text2SQL">
  <data key="d0">Text2SQL</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Text2SQL is a technique used in the Sanic-Web project to convert natural language questions into SQL queries for data Q&amp;A.&lt;SEP&gt;Text2SQL is a method used for converting natural language queries into SQL, enabling graphical data Q&amp;A display.&lt;SEP&gt;Text2SQL is a method described in the surrounding context that enables data graphical Q&amp;A by converting natural language queries into SQL for data retrieval and visualization.&lt;SEP&gt;Text2SQL is a method used by Sanic-Web to convert natural language questions into SQL queries for data visualization.</data>
