<node id="FastMCP">
  <data key="d0">FastMCP</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">FastMCP is a Python framework used to create MCP application instances and register tools.&lt;SEP&gt;FastMCP is a framework for building and testing MCP services, used to create an application instance named "demo" and register tools.&lt;SEP&gt;FastMCP is a Python framework used to create an MCP application instance named 'demo' and register tools for weather and stock queries.&lt;SEP&gt;FastMCP is a Python library used to create MCP server applications, imported in the code to build the demo server.&lt;SEP&gt;FastMCP is a Python framework used to create MCP server applications, instantiated in the code as an application named "demo".</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ac52de499112f50a44504163e36d0194&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-028b6088d3cdecf0364e7e5da0b83b66&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-886c2e8ce4df58fde41127defb87413b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-677387b0d12710d9b55ebc13fd550e1e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d14809c97d977d90b6981933292df49d</data>
