<node id="Weather Tool">
  <data key="d0">Weather Tool</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">The weather tool is a registered MCP tool for querying city weather information, returning preset data for cities like Beijing and Shanghai.&lt;SEP&gt;The weather tool is a registered FastMCP tool for querying city weather, returning preset data for cities like Beijing and Shanghai.&lt;SEP&gt;The weather tool is a registered FastMCP tool named 'weather' for querying city weather information, returning preset data for Beijing and Shanghai.&lt;SEP&gt;The weather tool is a registered FastMCP tool named "weather" with description "城市天气查询" that returns preset weather data for cities such as北京and上海.&lt;SEP&gt;The Weather Tool is a registered tool named "weather" with the description "城市天气查询" that returns preset weather data for cities such as北京and上海, or an error if the city is not found.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ac52de499112f50a44504163e36d0194&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-028b6088d3cdecf0364e7e5da0b83b66&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-886c2e8ce4df58fde41127defb87413b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-677387b0d12710d9b55ebc13fd550e1e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d14809c97d977d90b6981933292df49d</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/drw/PycharmProjects/RAG-Anything-reproduction/data/MCP服务.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791615475</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Stock Tool">
  <data key="d0">Stock Tool</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">The stock tool is a registered MCP tool for querying stock prices by code, returning preset data for stocks like Kweichow Moutai and Wuliangye.&lt;SEP&gt;The stock tool is a registered FastMCP tool for querying stock prices by code, returning data such as the price of Guizhou Moutai.&lt;SEP&gt;The stock tool is a registered FastMCP tool named 'stock' for querying stock prices by code, returning preset data for 600519 and 000858.&lt;SEP&gt;The stock tool is a registered FastMCP tool named "stock" with description "股票价格查询" that returns preset stock data for codes such as 600519 and 000858.&lt;SEP&gt;The Stock Tool is a registered tool named "stock" with the description "股票价格查询" that returns preset stock data for codes such as 600519 and 000858, or an error if the stock is not found.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ac52de499112f50a44504163e36d0194&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-028b6088d3cdecf0364e7e5da0b83b66&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-886c2e8ce4df58fde41127defb87413b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-677387b0d12710d9b55ebc13fd550e1e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d14809c97d977d90b6981933292df49d</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/drw/PycharmProjects/RAG-Anything-reproduction/data/MCP服务.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791615475</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Beijing">
  <data key="d0">Beijing</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">Beijing is a city whose weather was queried through the weather tool, returning a temperature of 25 and sunny conditions.&lt;SEP&gt;Beijing is a city with preset weather data in the weather tool, showing temperature 25 and sunny condition.&lt;SEP&gt;Beijing is a city with weather data showing a temperature of 25 degrees and sunny conditions.&lt;SEP&gt;Beijing is a city whose weather query returns a temperature of 25 degrees Celsius and sunny conditions.&lt;SEP&gt;Beijing is a city in the preset weather data with temperature 25°C and condition晴.&lt;SEP&gt;Beijing is a city included in the preset weather data with a temperature of 25 and a condition of "晴".</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ac52de499112f50a44504163e36d0194&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-028b6088d3cdecf0364e7e5da0b83b66&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f36f33d14dcadc9d9f0360473719433d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-886c2e8ce4df58fde41127defb87413b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-677387b0d12710d9b55ebc13fd550e1e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d14809c97d977d90b6981933292df49d</data>
