  <data key="d0">Weather Data</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">Weather Data is preset data in the weather tool mapping cities like Beijing and Shanghai to temperature and condition values.&lt;SEP&gt;Weather Data is a dictionary containing temperature and condition information for cities like Beijing and Shanghai.</data>
