<node id="Stock Data">
  <data key="d0">Stock Data</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">Stock Data is the result returned by the stock tool, containing the name and price of a stock such as Guizhou Moutai.&lt;SEP&gt;Stock Data is a dictionary containing stock information including names and prices for stocks like Kweichow Moutai and Wuliangye.</data>
