  <data key="d0">Error Handling Test</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">Error Handling Test is a test in the MCPTest Python script that queries a non-existent city to verify error responses.&lt;SEP&gt;The error handling test is a test in mcptest.py that queries a non-existent city and returns an error message '未找到该城市'.</data>
