<node id="MCPHub">
  <data key="d0">MCPHub</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">MCPHub is a tool for local deployment with one-click installation and group routing that reshapes the MCP server experience, featuring a built-in MCP server marketplace and Docker-based deployment.&lt;SEP&gt;MCPHub is a tool that includes a built-in MCP server marketplace with many commonly used MCP servers, supports one-click installation and automatic configuration, and can be deployed via Docker on any platform that supports Docker.&lt;SEP&gt;MCPHub is a tool that无趣deployed and configured with local MCP services.&lt;SEP&gt;MCPHub is a platform or service that Amoypark deployed and configured with local MCP services.&lt;SEP&gt;MCPHub is a deployment topic discussed in the surrounding text of the discussion thread.&lt;SEP&gt;MCPHub is a platform referenced in the context of building a local MCP platform.&lt;SEP&gt;MCPHub is a tool or platform mentioned in the context of a technical discussion about deploying MCP services.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-7dfd9edaf2d6d316a2d66cb563a7b6fd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cd96a7b68c52bd13466193e24646560d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e7d9cd3023643e2df6531a006385352f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-46e12b3f95e745beb9427a8d2c356fd6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-62c6000d6de041c5bcf23c16a5e559e8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1d4763d461b0f95b8e08fd85bc46bd41&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cc458fff436dfae5dc91224ef0d7b0dc</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/drw/PycharmProjects/RAG-Anything-reproduction/data/MCP服务.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791615464</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="SSE">
  <data key="d0">SSE</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">SSE is one of the connection methods (alongside MCP) used when Dify connects to MCPHub.&lt;SEP&gt;SSE is one of the connection methods mentioned by孙青扬for connecting Dify to MCPHub.&lt;SEP&gt;SSE is a connection method mentioned alongside MCP as one of the specific ways to use Dify.&lt;SEP&gt;SSE is one of the connection methods suggested by孙青扬for connecting Dify to MCPHub.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-7dfd9edaf2d6d316a2d66cb563a7b6fd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e7d9cd3023643e2df6531a006385352f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-62c6000d6de041c5bcf23c16a5e559e8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cc458fff436dfae5dc91224ef0d7b0dc</data>
