<node id="Amoypark">
  <data key="d0">Amoypark</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Amoypark is a user who asks about offline deployment, specifically whether plugins need to be downloaded on a networked machine and packaged into an image for offline servers.&lt;SEP&gt;Amoypark is a discussion participant who asks about offline deployment, specifically whether plugins need to be downloaded on an internet-connected machine and then packaged into an image file for use on an offline server.&lt;SEP&gt;Amoypark is a user who successfully deployed MCPHub and added local MCP services, but encountered issues when connecting Dify to MCPHub as MCP tools could not be invoked.&lt;SEP&gt;Amoypark is a user who asks a question about offline deployment of MCP services, specifically whether plugins need to be downloaded on a networked machine and then packaged into an image file for use on an offline server.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-7dfd9edaf2d6d316a2d66cb563a7b6fd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-46e12b3f95e745beb9427a8d2c356fd6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-62c6000d6de041c5bcf23c16a5e559e8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cc458fff436dfae5dc91224ef0d7b0dc</data>
