</node>
<node id="MCP-Server-Chart">
  <data key="d0">MCP-Server-Chart</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">MCP-Server-Chart is a component where the apconw/gpt-vis-api service is configured.&lt;SEP&gt;MCP-server-chart is a chart generation MCP service that runs on port 1122 via SSE transport.&lt;SEP&gt;MCP-Server-Chart is a visualization MCP service that contains over 25 visual charts using @antvis, designed for chart generation and data analysis, and requires a remote service to function.&lt;SEP&gt;MCP-Server-Chart is the source specified in the Sankey diagram generation request.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-7dfd9edaf2d6d316a2d66cb563a7b6fd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-028b6088d3cdecf0364e7e5da0b83b66&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9e438aec0e2c5ce9de0dd0bb23713997&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3da2e3ba09aaf5c26f390a62fa29f730</data>
