<node id="Line Chart">
  <data key="d0">Line Chart</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">A line chart is a type of chart that gpt-vis-api can generate from JSON data requests.&lt;SEP&gt;The Line Chart is a generated visualization with two data points: 2025-05 with value 512 and 2025-06 with value 1024, connected by a straight blue line.&lt;SEP&gt;The Line Chart is a chart type generated via the API with data points for 2025-05 (value 512) and 2025-06 (value 1024), resulting in an uploaded chart image.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-7dfd9edaf2d6d316a2d66cb563a7b6fd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3da2e3ba09aaf5c26f390a62fa29f730&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9208d3d4d0af3445436567fdc54112d7</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/drw/PycharmProjects/RAG-Anything-reproduction/data/MCP服务.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791615470</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Bar Chart">
  <data key="d0">Bar Chart</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">A bar chart is a type of chart that gpt-vis-api can generate from JSON data requests.&lt;SEP&gt;Bar Chart is a chart type proposed as a limited tool in an alternative solution for local deployment.&lt;SEP&gt;A bar chart titled '空军岗山基地各部门人员分布' was generated by the AI, showing personnel distribution across departments.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-7dfd9edaf2d6d316a2d66cb563a7b6fd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f36f33d14dcadc9d9f0360473719433d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d8df96894d64e07a9d6fc07e19e8f283</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/drw/PycharmProjects/RAG-Anything-reproduction/data/MCP服务.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791615479</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Sankey Diagram">
  <data key="d0">Sankey Diagram</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">A sankey diagram is a type of chart generated in the test case, depicting a user purchase journey with nodes such as visiting the website, browsing products, adding to cart, checkout, and payment.&lt;SEP&gt;A Sankey diagram titled "用户购买旅程桑基图" (User Purchase Journey Sankey Diagram) generated by the chart service.&lt;SEP&gt;The Sankey Diagram is a chart type generated via the API visualizing a user purchase journey, titled "用户购买旅程桑基图", with specified node alignment, style, theme, and dimensions.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-7dfd9edaf2d6d316a2d66cb563a7b6fd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-028b6088d3cdecf0364e7e5da0b83b66&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3da2e3ba09aaf5c26f390a62fa29f730</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/drw/PycharmProjects/RAG-Anything-reproduction/data/MCP服务.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791615470</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="User Purchase Journey Sankey Diagram">
  <data key="d0">User Purchase Journey Sankey Diagram</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">The User Purchase Journey Sankey Diagram is a test chart generated by gpt-vis-api showing the flow from visiting the website through browsing, adding to cart, checkout, and payment or abandonment.&lt;SEP&gt;The User Purchase Journey Sankey Diagram is a chart titled "用户购买旅程桑基图" generated with dimensions 800x500 using the WenQuanYi Zen Hei font.&lt;SEP&gt;The User Purchase Journey Sankey Diagram is a Sankey diagram visualizing the flow of users through a website purchase funnel, with stages from visiting the website to completing or abandoning payment.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-7dfd9edaf2d6d316a2d66cb563a7b6fd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-028b6088d3cdecf0364e7e5da0b83b66&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3da2e3ba09aaf5c26f390a62fa29f730</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/drw/PycharmProjects/RAG-Anything-reproduction/data/MCP服务.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791615470</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
