<node id="Local Deployment">
  <data key="d0">Local Deployment</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Local deployment is a deployment approach supported by MCPHub for running MCP servers on local machines.&lt;SEP&gt;Local deployment refers to running tools or models on local infrastructure, suggested as an alternative solution for chart generation.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-7dfd9edaf2d6d316a2d66cb563a7b6fd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-796cca4fcff695d899b8a0523c299544</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/drw/PycharmProjects/RAG-Anything-reproduction/data/MCP服务.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791615481</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Offline Deployment">
  <data key="d0">Offline Deployment</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Offline deployment is a deployment approach discussed by Amoypark and Sun Qingyang, involving downloading plugins on a networked machine and packaging them into an image for offline servers.&lt;SEP&gt;Offline deployment is a strategy discussed by Amoypark involving downloading required plugins on an internet-connected machine, packaging them into an image file, and transferring them to an offline server.&lt;SEP&gt;Offline Deployment is a method of deploying services on servers without internet access, requiring plugins to be downloaded on a networked machine and packaged into image files.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-7dfd9edaf2d6d316a2d66cb563a7b6fd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-46e12b3f95e745beb9427a8d2c356fd6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-62c6000d6de041c5bcf23c16a5e559e8</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/drw/PycharmProjects/RAG-Anything-reproduction/data/MCP服务.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791615477</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
