<node id="Qwen3:32b">
  <data key="d0">Qwen3:32b</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Qwen3:32b is a 32-billion-parameter large language model that has been evaluated in the context of invoking MCP (Model Context Protocol) services. It is described as both a local and an online/networked model, and it is also referenced as a chat model used by the Agent node in the Dify workflow, as well as in the neighbor text of an image content analysis.

Across multiple tests, Qwen3:32b demonstrated an ability to connect to and call MCP services when networked, but it consistently produced garbled output (乱码). When attempting to generate charts through MCP services, the model encountered significant issues: it failed to successfully call the gpt-vis-api service, could not invoke the chart MCP tool, and got stuck halfway through execution without completing the RPC 5 tools/call invocation. These problems with getting stuck during execution were reported both for chart generation and for general MCP service operation. One description characterizes Qwen3:32b as a small language model, which conflicts with the more prevalent characterization of it as a large model; this discrepancy may reflect differing evaluation contexts or labeling errors. Overall, the descriptions consistently highlight functional difficulties with MCP service invocation, particularly garbled output and execution stalls, despite the model's nominal connectivity.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-028b6088d3cdecf0364e7e5da0b83b66&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f36f33d14dcadc9d9f0360473719433d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-629ff97ba9b08501fb91ecc6de8ffc80&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e9f3e6cbaad85774625cbce27c7b8383&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0825df065525dd92af8d2c20f70b3388&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5b0c6a1890889cb47462112bf019f02f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-22289987ab43c6909c9d91c1d8530ece&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-af0cb0c15a552c37fc70116a7ff063ed&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f5702ae24a0f62f9c64271f9c3ff84f6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6cb0f2f468eb972869d2a51b23a64211</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/drw/PycharmProjects/RAG-Anything-reproduction/data/MCP服务.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791615465</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
