  <data key="d0">Qwen3:30b</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Qwen3:30b is a local large language model that cannot invoke MCP tools/call.&lt;SEP&gt;Qwen3:30b is a local large language model that is unable to call MCP tools.&lt;SEP&gt;Qwen3:30b is a locally pulled model from Ollama that was tested to see if it could call MCP tools/call, but it also failed to invoke them.&lt;SEP&gt;Qwen3:30b is a locally run model pulled via ollama that was tested to see if it could invoke MCP tools/call, but it failed to make the call.</data>
