  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Qwen3:14b is an online large language model that can invoke MCP services but returns format errors without images.&lt;SEP&gt;Qwen3:14b is a model mentioned in the surrounding context as being able to call MCP services, even if the output format is incorrect.&lt;SEP&gt;Qwen3:14b is an online model that was able to invoke the MCP service, though it returned a format error and did not return an image, it did successfully send a request.</data>
