<node id="Tool Calls">
  <data key="d0">Tool Calls</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Tool Calls are requests made by large language models to invoke external tools, which Llama3.3 reportedly returns without producing final results.&lt;SEP&gt;Tool calls refer to the mechanism by which AI models invoke external functions, which in the described case fail to return results.&lt;SEP&gt;Tool calls are a mechanism where a model invokes external tools, and the recursion depth of tool calls can be configured.&lt;SEP&gt;Tool calls are a model behavior where the model invokes tools, and the recursion depth of tool calls can be configured; excessive tool calls without returning results is a reported issue.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f36f33d14dcadc9d9f0360473719433d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-78ecb26ec990da909579b2d0d8e16aa6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ac5e894e81be3f4f149dd2361ff4710b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a0f6b87323bdb838bd0839433c2a27ab</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/drw/PycharmProjects/RAG-Anything-reproduction/data/MCP服务.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791615484</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Maximum Tool Calls Recursion Depth">
  <data key="d0">Maximum Tool Calls Recursion Depth</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Maximum Tool Calls Recursion Depth is a configurable setting that limits how many times tool calls can recurse, suggested as a solution for models stuck in tool call loops.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f36f33d14dcadc9d9f0360473719433d</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/drw/PycharmProjects/RAG-Anything-reproduction/data/MCP服务.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791615088</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
