  <data key="d2">MCP服务refers to an MCP service, appearing in the file path of the image within the parsed document structure.&lt;SEP&gt;MCP服务refers to the MCP (Model Context Protocol) service that was implemented in a simple form and tested using a small model on Dify.&lt;SEP&gt;MCP服务refers to an MCP service discussed in the document, related to model tool calls and integration issues.&lt;SEP&gt;MCP服务is a document or section referenced in the file path, related to the Dify测试section discussing AI model tool call issues.&lt;SEP&gt;MCP服务refers to the Model Context Protocol service, related to integration issues involving tool calls and error messages.</data>
