  <data key="d0">Sad Television Character</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">The Sad Television Character is a stylized anthropomorphic figure with a vintage television-shaped head, antennae, and a tired or disappointed facial expression, used as an avatar or error icon.</data>
