<node id="Tools/Call">
  <data key="d0">Tools/Call</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Tools/call is a JSON-RPC method used to invoke a specific tool, and its call succeeded in the log.&lt;SEP&gt;Tools/call is an MCP RPC method for invoking tools, which the local qwen3:30b model failed to call.&lt;SEP&gt;Tools/call is an MCP invocation method that the models were tested on for support.&lt;SEP&gt;Tools/Call is a JSON-RPC 2.0 method sent by the client to the MCP server to invoke a specific tool, which failed when attempting to call generate_pin_map.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e9f3e6cbaad85774625cbce27c7b8383&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3d8028699a132034eca5b3a45821eee0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-72d350e3bb80f0fef24e7c96667c4d8a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6cb0f2f468eb972869d2a51b23a64211</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/drw/PycharmProjects/RAG-Anything-reproduction/data/MCP服务.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791615468</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Node.js Server">
  <data key="d0">Node.js Server</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">The Node.js server runs the mcp-server-chart-main project via node build/index.js with SSE transport, logging incoming HTTP POST requests and RPC calls.</data>
