  <data key="d0">Workflow</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Workflow refers to the Dify workflow execution indicated in the AI assistant's response.&lt;SEP&gt;Workflow refers to the process of combining text and charts to answer queries.&lt;SEP&gt;Workflow is a section topic under which the image content analysis is categorized.&lt;SEP&gt;Workflow is the execution process of the agent, including steps like Start, Loop, Agent, Direct Reply, and Variable Assignment.</data>
