  <data key="d2">MCP tools are functionalities provided through MCPHub that could not be invoked when connecting via Dify.&lt;SEP&gt;MCP Tools are tools provided through MCP services that无趣was unable to invoke after connecting Dify to MCPHub.&lt;SEP&gt;MCP tools are the various tools provided by the MCP service, whose number can be limited to enable invocation by Qwen3:32b.</data>
