<node id="Add To Cart">
  <data key="d0">Add To Cart</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Add to Cart is the second stage of the funnel with a value of 35000 and a conversion rate of 70.00%.&lt;SEP&gt;Add To Cart is a stage in the user purchase journey where users add items to their cart, receiving flow from browsing products and splitting into entering checkout or leaving the website.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-3da2e3ba09aaf5c26f390a62fa29f730&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-46181a4ab3fb239f80f036ff52b8d520</data>
