<node id="Environment Dependency And Configuration">
  <data key="d0">Environment Dependency And Configuration</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Complex environment dependencies and configuration refer to the challenges of maintaining multiple runtimes, commands, parameters, and environment variables for MCP servers.&lt;SEP&gt;Environment dependency and configuration refers to the complex issues of setting up consistent environments and configurations, which MCPHub aims to simplify through its marketplace and Docker deployment.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2c6746154ee72afea8c47d8e88a7e50e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1d4763d461b0f95b8e08fd85bc46bd41</data>
