<node id="Agent">
  <data key="d0">Agent</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The Agent is a node in the Dify workflow that uses the ReAct strategy with MCP tools to process queries and generate responses.&lt;SEP&gt;Agent is a configuration panel in a low-code AI agent development platform, featuring an agent strategy and model selection.&lt;SEP&gt;Agent is an AI component configured with ReAct strategy and MCP tools to process user queries and generate responses.&lt;SEP&gt;The Agent is a node in the Dify workflow that uses the ReAct strategy with MCP tool support to process queries and generate responses.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-3d8028699a132034eca5b3a45821eee0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-886c2e8ce4df58fde41127defb87413b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-796cca4fcff695d899b8a0523c299544&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-af0cb0c15a552c37fc70116a7ff063ed</data>
