  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="MCP Server Chart">
  <data key="d0">MCP Server Chart</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">MCP Server Chart is a server component configured via mcpServers that uses the @antv/mcp-server-chart package and requires a private service address through the VIS_REQUEST_SERVER environment variable.&lt;SEP&gt;MCP Server Chart is the source system that provided the data for generating the Sankey chart.&lt;SEP&gt;MCP Server Chart is a specific MCP service configured with SSE transport at URL http://host.docker.internal:1122/sse for generating charts.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9208d3d4d0af3445436567fdc54112d7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-796cca4fcff695d899b8a0523c299544&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6c5109d1ac12173a5f2731bc015b2d44</data>
