  <data key="d0">Organizational Chart</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">The organizational chart is a hierarchical diagram displayed in the image, showing the structure of the Taiwan region maritime and air forces.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-5b0c6a1890889cb47462112bf019f02f</data>
