  <data key="d0">Mind-Mapping Software Interface</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">The mind-mapping software interface is the software tool shown in the image, featuring a dark gray top menu bar and a hierarchical diagram canvas.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-5b0c6a1890889cb47462112bf019f02f</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/drw/PycharmProjects/RAG-Anything-reproduction/data/MCP服务.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791615475</data>
