<node id="Model Capability Issue">
  <data key="d0">Model Capability Issue</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Model Capability Issue is the question raised in the document section '是模型能力的问题吗？' regarding whether the failure to invoke MCP tools is due to the model's capabilities.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-72d350e3bb80f0fef24e7c96667c4d8a</data>
