  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">An Offline Server is a server without internet access where MCP services are deployed using packaged image files.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-46e12b3f95e745beb9427a8d2c356fd6</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/drw/PycharmProjects/RAG-Anything-reproduction/data/MCP服务.pdf</data>
