<node id="General Q&amp;A">
  <data key="d0">General Q&amp;A</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">General Q&amp;A is a capability card in the AI assistant interface that supports multi-model, multi-agent, and MCP collaborative tasks, and fully supports mainstream large model interaction frameworks such as Dify and LangChain.&lt;SEP&gt;General Q&amp;A is a navigation menu item in the Sanic-Web application for general question answering.&lt;SEP&gt;General Q&amp;A is a navigation menu item in the Sanic-Web dashboard for general question answering.</data>
