  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Table Q&amp;A is a capability card that supports general data form Q&amp;A based on third-party RAG system and public network retrieval mode, and serves as a lightweight full-link one-stop large model application development framework.&lt;SEP&gt;Table Q&amp;A is a navigation menu item in the Sanic-Web application for querying tabular data.&lt;SEP&gt;Table Q&amp;A is a navigation menu item in the Sanic-Web dashboard for table-related question answering.</data>
