<edge source="MCP" target="Dify">
  <data key="d7">4.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Dify v1.6.0 supports two-way MCP, allowing direct calls to any MCP service and publishing Dify workflows as MCP services.&lt;SEP&gt;Dify can quickly integrate local MCP services and expose its own apps as MCP servers for any client to invoke.&lt;SEP&gt;Dify's connection stability depends on the specific usage method, including MCP.&lt;SEP&gt;Dify's small model was used to test a simple MCP service implementation.</data>
  <data key="d9">connection method,integration,model integration,platform integration,service invocation,technical usage,testing,two-way support</data>
